[TEST] Perform a targeted neurological examination including:  
- Mini-Mental State Examination (MMSE) or Montreal Cognitive Assessment (MoCA) screening;  
- Verbal fluency test (e.g., “name as many animals as you can in 60 seconds”);  
- Executive function screen (e.g., alternating trail-making A/B or Luria fist-edge-palm test);  
- Frontal release signs (grasp reflex, palmomental reflex);  
- Gait and balance observation;  
- Eye movement assessment (saccades, smooth pursuit, convergence).

